  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at increasing protection of the rights of trafficked children and children at high risk of being trafficked from South Easter Europe. The objectives are to prevent trafficking of children by strengthening children protection mechanisms for children at high risk of being trafficked, this through strengthening identification, referral and support mechanisms.</narrative>
